message: "Cite the source paper for its mathematical results; this citation identifies the Lean formalization."
title: "Uniform attachment with freezing: Scaling limits — Lean formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kortchemski
    given-names: Igor
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the scaling-limit results of "Uniform
  attachment with freezing: Scaling limits": the height theorem, the subcritical
  GHP limit, the critical limit as a random compact real tree with its geometric
  properties, and the (corrected) supercritical distance-matrix limit, together
  with the numbered intermediate results. The CRT corollary is not formalized.
  FORMALIZATION_REPORT.md records the exact scope, corrections and remaining
  obligations. Developed with automated proof and statement-audit assistance.
